{
  "informative": [
    "SCIERA reproduction of the #103/#104 BFD outage seen with wireguard-go (br-bug-report.md,",
    "Issue A, 2026-11-06 and 2026-11-09). Same hosts, paths, shaping and forward loads as",
    "hummbwtester-sciera.json, which never showed the outage. What differs from it, to match the",
    "wireguard-go runs:",
    "",
    "+---------------+            +---------------+            +---------------+",
    "| ufes          |            | rnp           |            | ufms          |",
    "| AS 71-2:0:152 |            | AS 71-1916    |            | AS 71-2:0:5c  |",
    "| best-effort-1 |#101----#106| hummingbird-1 |#103----#104| server :12345 |",
    "+---------------+            +---------------+            +---------------+",
    "",
    "1. Reverse load (ufms -> rnp). wireguard-go sent TCP acks of the copy, 5 pings/s, and",
    "   tunnel replies back over #104 -> #103; hummbwtester only 1 pong/s. The server answers each",
    "   pong over the reversed path (Hummingbird: the reverse reservation), so pong_rate sets the",
    "   reverse load: 200/s for hummingbird-1 (delayed acks of ~4.8 Mbps of full-size segments, plus",
    "   pings), 5/s for best-effort-1 (its pings; these replies cross rnp #103 -> #106).",
    "2. Packet size: payload_size 1350 instead of 800, close to full wireguard-go packets. It must fit",
    "   the SCION MTU 1472 of #101/#106 (minus ~112 bytes of SCION/UDP headers): VLAN 137 drops",
    "   larger frames, so 1452 silently lost every best-effort payload packet between ufes and rnp.",
    "3. Reverse reservation 1 Mbps, as wireguard-go bought, instead of 5 Mbps.",
    "4. Duration 6 h: the outage happened about once per 2 h of load.",
    "",
    "Capture both ends of #103/#104 during the run (filter 'udp port 50031 and less 400', which",
    "keeps BFD, pongs and SCMP but not the bulk payload); see br-bug-report.md."
  ],
  "hummingbird": {
    "reservation_source": "marketplace",
    "marketplace": {
      "host": "ufms",
      "scion_address": "[71-2:0:5c,127.0.0.1]:31888",
      "username": "alice",
      "password_env": "HUMMBWTESTER_MARKETPLACE_PASSWORD",
      "location_override": true,
      "interfaces": {
        "71-1916": [0,103,106],
        "71-2:0:152": [0,101],
        "71-2:0:5c": [0,104]
      }
    }
  },
  "server": {
    "node": "ufms",
    "isd_as": "71-2:0:5c",
    "host": "127.0.0.1",
    "port": 12345,
    "receive_buffer_size": 4194304
  },
  "hummingbird_clients": [
    {
      "client_id": "hummingbird-1",
      "node": "rnp",
      "isd_as": "71-1916",
      "host": "127.0.0.1",
      "port": 0,
      "bandwidth": "5Mbps",
      "maxburst": "50Mbps",
      "duration": "6h",
      "payload_size": 1350,
      "pong_rate": 200,
      "path_to_server_filter": "71-1916#103 71-2:0:5c#104",
      "hummingbird_reservation": {
        "bandwidth": "5mbps",
        "duration": "5m",
        "reverse_bandwidth": "1mbps",
        "renewal_ahead": "30s",
        "reservation_overlap": "20s",
        "humm_start_offset": "-5s",
        "partial": "71-1916,71-2:0:5c",
        "path_to_marketplace_filter": "71-1916#3 71-2:0:5c#4"
      }
    }
  ],
  "best_effort_clients": [
    {
      "client_id": "best-effort-1",
      "node": "ufes",
      "isd_as": "71-2:0:152",
      "host": "127.0.0.1",
      "port": 0,
      "bandwidth": "10Mbps",
      "maxburst": "20Mbps",
      "duration": "6h",
      "payload_size": 1350,
      "pong_rate": 5,
      "path_to_server_filter": "71-2:0:152#101 71-1916#106,103 71-2:0:5c#104"
    }
  ],
  "deployment": {
    "kind": "ssh",
    "hosts": {
      "rnp": {
        "ssh": "sciera-rnp",
        "sciond": "127.0.0.1:30255",
        "run_dir": "/var/tmp/hummbwtester",
        "control_service": "scion-control-service-cs1.service"
      },
      "ufes": {
        "ssh": "sciera-ufes",
        "sciond": "127.0.0.1:30255",
        "run_dir": "/var/tmp/hummbwtester",
        "control_service": "scion-control-service-cs1.service"
      },
      "ufms": {
        "ssh": "sciera-ufms",
        "sciond": "127.0.0.1:30255",
        "run_dir": "/var/tmp/hummbwtester",
        "control_service": "scion-control@cs-1.service"
      }
    },
    "metrics": {
      "prometheus": "ufms",
      "local_port_base": 19090,
      "routers": [
        {
          "host": "rnp",
          "address": "127.0.0.1:38401",
          "labels": {
            "as": "71_1916",
            "br": "br-2"
          }
        },
        {
          "host": "ufes",
          "address": "127.0.0.1:38401",
          "labels": {
            "as": "71_2_0_152",
            "br": "br-2"
          }
        },
        {
          "host": "ufms",
          "address": "127.0.0.1:38401",
          "labels": {
            "as": "71_2_0_5c",
            "br": "br-2"
          }
        },
        {
          "host": "rnp",
          "address": "127.0.0.1:30401",
          "labels": {
            "as": "71_1916",
            "br": "br-1"
          },
          "display": false
        },
        {
          "host": "ufes",
          "address": "127.0.0.1:30401",
          "labels": {
            "as": "71_2_0_152",
            "br": "br-1"
          },
          "display": false
        },
        {
          "host": "ufms",
          "address": "127.0.0.1:30401",
          "labels": {
            "as": "71_2_0_5c",
            "br": "br-1"
          },
          "display": false
        }
      ]
    },
    "shaping": [
      {
        "host": "rnp",
        "name": "rnp-ufms",
        "device": "eno4.140",
        "local": "[fe80::77c:140%eno4.140]:50031",
        "remote": "[fe80::2:0:5c:140]:50031",
        "expected_root": "noqueue"
      },
      {
        "host": "ufms",
        "name": "ufms-rnp",
        "device": "ens2f1.140",
        "local": "[fe80::2:0:5c:140%ens2f1.140]:50031",
        "remote": "[fe80::77c:140]:50031",
        "expected_root": "noqueue"
      },
      {
        "host": "rnp",
        "name": "rnp-ufes",
        "device": "eno4.137",
        "local": "10.6.7.2:50001",
        "remote": "10.6.7.1:50001",
        "expected_root": "noqueue"
      },
      {
        "host": "ufes",
        "name": "ufes-rnp",
        "device": "ens192",
        "local": "10.6.7.1:50001",
        "remote": "10.6.7.2:50001",
        "expected_root": "mq"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tc": {
    "rate": "10mbit",
    "burst": "50kb",
    "limit": "256kb"
  }
}
